<title>UK: Boots says launching Nurofen in Russia.</title>
<headline>Boots says launching Nurofen in Russia.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Boots Co Plc said on it is introducing the painkilling drug Nurofen into Russia this month.</p>
<p>Nurofen, discovered by researchers at Boots in 1969, is one of the world's major drugs, being the original ibuprofen painkiller and the UK's bestselling painkiller.</p>
<p>Since being launched as an over-the-counter breakthrough in pain relief, Nurofen has been used by millions worldwide to provide relief from a range of conditions including headaches, colds and flu symptoms, rheumatic pain, muscular pain, migraine and dental pain.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
